            "review_text": "F Lem\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia45 contributions\n0\nDelicious Halal Food\nMar 2019 • Family\nHighly recommended, especially for Muslim customers. \nSpacious seating area, free wifi and payment by card is available. Restaurant is fully air-conditioned so you can enjoy the food in comfort. I highly recommend for you to try their Beef Pho, Bread with Sardine, Bingka Ubi and Spring Rolls. These are to die for!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 1, 2019",
